---
import GuideLayout from '../../layouts/GuideLayout.astro';
---
<GuideLayout 
  title="The Ultimate Logistics Guide: Shipping Activewear from China"
  type="LOGISTICS"
  description="Navigate the complexities of international shipping. From Guangzhou factory floor to your warehouse in Miami or Europe."
>
  <p>For global activewear brands, the efficiency of the supply chain from the <strong>Guangzhou factory floor to your warehouse</strong> determines your time-to-market and profit margins. Production is only half the battle; managing the movement of goods is what ensures success.</p>
  
  <div class="my-10 bg-black text-white p-12 rounded-3xl text-center shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-[url('https://sc01.alicdn.com/kf/Hda9265e06f104fb7a323d391cceba604W.jpg')] bg-cover"></div>
    <h3 class="text-[#C9A84C] mt-0 text-2xl font-bold uppercase tracking-widest relative z-10">Strategic Logistics Hub</h3>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mt-10 relative z-10">
      <div><p class="text-2xl font-bold">Guangzhou</p><p class="text-[10px] text-[#C9A84C] uppercase tracking-widest">Baiyun Airport</p></div>
      <div><p class="text-2xl font-bold">Shenzhen</p><p class="text-[10px] text-[#C9A84C] uppercase tracking-widest">Global Port</p></div>
      <div><p class="text-2xl font-bold">Hong Kong</p><p class="text-[10px] text-[#C9A84C] uppercase tracking-widest">Airfreight Hub</p></div>
      <div><p class="text-2xl font-bold">Miami</p><p class="text-[10px] text-[#C9A84C] uppercase tracking-widest">Distribution Center</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>Choosing the Right Shipping Method</h2>
  <p>Different order sizes and timelines require different strategies. We work with premium partners to offer three main shipping tiers:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Air Express (DHL/FedEx):</strong> Best for samples and small MOQ orders (50-200 pcs). Transit: 3-5 days. Door-to-door convenience.</li>
    <li><strong>Air Freight:</strong> Best for bulk orders over 300kg. Transit: 7-10 days. Balanced cost-to-speed ratio.</li>
    <li><strong>Sea Freight (LCL/FCL):</strong> Best for large seasonal launches. Transit: 25-45 days. Lowest cost per unit, maximizing margins.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Customs & DDP (Delivered Duty Paid)</h2>
  <p>We provide full documentation, accurate HS coding, and DDP services for the US and EU markets. This means we handle all taxes and customs clearance, delivering directly to your door with zero hidden fees.</p>

  <p><em>Need a landing cost calculation for your next order? Contact our logistics team with your destination city for a quote within 1 hour.</em></p>
</GuideLayout>
